## Product sync (no second Vercel login)

Shared Staff / portal / checkout / Cove product lives in **`pavilion/frontend`**.

Catch demo/trial up from school:

```bash
node scripts/sync-product-between-repos.mjs --from-shms --dry-run
node scripts/sync-product-between-repos.mjs --from-shms --apply
```

Prep www from Pavilion product:

```bash
node scripts/sync-product-between-repos.mjs --to-shms --dry-run
node scripts/sync-product-between-repos.mjs --to-shms --apply
# then commit + git push origin main in ~/shmspto
```

Stone Hill production = **git push** `auraflux-dev/shmspto` `main`. Treasurer auto-deploys. Agents do not need the treasurer Vercel login.

